# Cloud services
user svc-ingest
topic read site/+/dev/+/telemetry
topic read site/+/dev/+/status
topic read site/+/gw/status
topic read site/+/cmd/+/ack
topic read site/+/job/+/result

user svc-api
topic write site/+/cmd/+
topic write site/+/job/+
topic write site/+/config
topic read site/+/cmd/+/ack
topic read site/+/job/+/result
topic read site/+/gw/status
# Claiming gateways (P5-04): certificate requests in, certificates out.
topic read claim/+/csr
topic write claim/+/cert

# The rules service sends approved commands (P3-04); acks come back through ingest.
user svc-rules
topic write site/+/cmd/+

user svc-health
topic read $SYS/#

# Gateways: the certificate CN is the site id, so a gateway can only reach its own site.
pattern readwrite site/%u/#

# A gateway not yet claimed connects with the shared bootstrap certificate and its serial as the
# client id: it can only ask for its certificate and hear the answer (P5-04). The request carries
# a proof of the claim code, so another box can't ask in its name; the answer is useless without
# the key that stays on the gateway.
pattern write claim/%c/csr
pattern read claim/%c/cert
